{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ensemblesgoogledrive"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"collection","externalID":"EnsemblesGoogleDrive","title":"EnsemblesGoogleDrive","modules":[{"name":"EnsemblesGoogleDrive"}],"symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework"},"abstract":[{"text":"A Google Drive cloud backend for Ensembles.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Cloud-File-System","identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem","doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveAuthenticator"],"title":"Cloud File System"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"EnsemblesGoogleDrive provides ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", an implementation of the Ensembles "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CloudFileSystem"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol that stores sync data on Google Drive. It communicates directly with the Google Drive REST API v3 using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLSession"},{"type":"text","text":" — no third-party SDK required."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Google Drive uses file IDs rather than paths internally. The backend transparently bridges between Ensembles’ path-based "},{"code":"CloudFileSystem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol and Google Drive’s ID-based system, caching folder and file IDs to minimize API calls."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Authentication","anchor":"Authentication","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","t